  "preconditions": [
    "parser entry 0x00492710 / 0x00492A40: a live parser object whose recursion counter this+404 and current-node pointer this+428 are coherent; the token stream is readable through the keyword readers sub_5654A0 / sub_565870",
    "0x00492A40: a2 (gizmo type name) must be non-NULL; a NULL name routes to the fatal 'undefined gizmo type' message path via sub_493C80",
    "0x00493480: a2 (action list) and a3 (event-trigger string) must be non-NULL, otherwise it returns -1 immediately",
    "0x00497AD0: a2 (surface path) must be non-NULL, otherwise it returns 0",
    "0x00497D20: a2 must be non-NULL and the device global dword_8AC4C4 must be non-NULL, otherwise it returns 0",
    "0x00494E60: dword_7CDDF0 may be NULL; the teardown is idempotent on an empty list",
    "0x0048E3A0: called on a font resource object; the resource handle at this+228 may be 0 and is only closed if present",
    "string-setter family (0x00498650): a2 must be non-NULL and strlen(a2)!=0 for the write to occur; otherwise no state change"
  ],
  "postconditions": [
    "0x00492710: parses the widget token stream; recursion counter this+404 is incremented then restored; this+428 is left NULL; returns 0",
    "0x00492A40: returns a constructed gizmo object or 0 for an unknown type; child gizmos are built recursively and linked via sub_486340; parser counters stay balanced",
    "0x00493480: appends 28-byte action nodes (type in +0, transition attribute in +0x14) to the target list in event-trigger order (click/release/focus/lost_focus/drop); returns 0, or -1 when args are invalid",
    "0x00497AD0: returns an existing surface registration or a new 20-byte surface_reg_entry; increments this[66] and links the node at the tail of the this[65] chain",
    "0x00497D20: returns 1 when the surface is loaded or already registered, 0 on failure; on success appends an 88-byte surface_entry at the tail of this[67] and increments this[68]",
    "0x00494E60: frees every list node and payload on the collision free list and zeroes dword_7CDDF0 / 7CDDF4 / 7CDDF8 / 7CDDFC",
    "0x004963D0: releases the child structures at this[1], this[7], this[60], this[65], this[67], the cursor resource and the this[43]/this[44] objects; zeroes this[1], this[2], this[7], this[43], this[44]",
    "constructor inits (0x0048E600, 0x0048E9E0, 0x00499A00, 0x00499AB0): leave the object's vtable pointer and listed fields in canonical reset state",
    "setters (0x00498650, 0x00498D00, 0x00499A30, 0x00499A70): copy the string into the target buffer and store the companion value; propagate the copy helper's return value"
  ],
  "side_effects": [
    "keyword/token matching through sub_5654A0 and sub_565870 against the content literals (name, surface, gizmo, child, actions, attributeset, friendgizmo, pos_w_h, location, position, widthheight, offset, caption/tooltip, do_page, do_layer, setsymbol, droppopups, exitgame, simulateclick)",
    "heap allocations: 28-byte action nodes (0x00493480), 20-byte surface_reg_entry (0x00497AD0), 88-byte surface_entry (0x00497D20), 104-byte gizmo container (0x00492710), 128-byte font context (0x0048E3A0); all released via FreeWrapper_7bcf in their teardown paths",
    "vtable dispatch: vtable pointers off_5AC540 (0x0048E600) and off_5A443C (0x0048E9E0) stored into object head; virtual notify at (*this+172) (0x0048E6B0); device vtable +68/+92 for surface creation (0x00497D20)",
    "global scratch state: byte_7CDCF0 and unk_7CDE38 written with formatted/error text; the shared empty string byte_5EA438 rewritten; collision free list globals dword_7CDDF0-FC zeroed; flt_7CF2CC consumed by sub_551EB0 (0x0048E3A0)",
    "0x0048E6B0 appends the object to a doubly linked list via DoublyLinkedListAppend_6750 and triggers the virtual refresh handler when the directory string differs",
    "0x004963D0 teardown calls CursorResourceCleanup(dword_7CB24C) and releases MAS/geometry children through the thunks 0x00494FD0 / 0x00494FE0 / 0x00495010",
